        "startIndex": 3881,
        "endIndex": 4023,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [4]: Clinicians Voice Caution Over Expanding Medical AI Beyond Diagnostics**\n* **Publisher:** Financial Times (Sarah Neville)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
