      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4484,
        "endIndex": 4637,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Reflects broader industry sentiment and survey analysis rather than a single regulatory ruling or corporate product cancellation"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        19,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4764,
        "endIndex": 4895,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [17]: Technical Analysis Highlights Practical Obstacles to AI \"Kill-Switch\" Laws**\n* **Publisher:** New York Times"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4764,
        "endIndex": 5121,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [17]: Technical Analysis Highlights Practical Obstacles to AI \"Kill-Switch\" Laws**\n* **Publisher:** New York Times\n* **What is confirmed:** AI researchers and computer scientists (including Geoffrey Hinton and David Bau) warn that mandatory \"kill switch\" mechanisms proposed in US federal and state legislation face severe technical hurdles"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        23,
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5123,
        "endIndex": 5304,
        "text": "Once autonomous agents replicate, distribute across cloud networks, or interface with external tools, centralized hardware/software cutoffs become easily circumvented or ineffective"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5306,
        "endIndex": 5419,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Explanatory policy and technical analysis piece; does not report new legislation passing"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
