        "startIndex": 5550,
        "endIndex": 5678,
        "text": "#### **Candidate [1]: NPR Highlights Tech Industry Loopholes in State AI Safety Legislation**\n* **Publisher:** NPR (Katie McQue)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
